<div id="content" class="flex flex-col container gap-3 pt-4 pb-6 px-3 mobile:px-2">
    <h1 class="content-header-title" dir="ltr">Help us improve</h1>
    <div class="flex flex-col gap-6" dir="ltr">
        <p>Our sites are made for you! There are a few things that you can do that help us improve our sites:</p>

        <div>
            <h3>Reporting</h3>
            <p>
                All images have a small flag icon located at the bottom right.
                Clicking this flag will allow you to report issues with this specific video or the site on which the
                video is hosted.
                Is the issue you want to report not listed? 
                <ahref="/contact/?pricing=membership-and-payperview-and-payperclip-and-fansubscription"><u>Contact us</u></a>!
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h3>Content voting</h3>
            <p>
                Voting for videos you have watched by giving them a “thumbs up” or “thumbs down” rating helps us to
                serve better content recommendations.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h3>User experience</h3>
            <p>
                In our report tool you are only able to report specific issues. It is very important to us that we only
                list sites that meet our strict Q&amp;A standards.
                Help us by <a class="email-link"
                    href="mailto:inquiries@adultwebmasternet.com?subject=Improve%20message%20in%20regard%20to%20www.qorno.com">reporting</a>
                advertising related issues or other issues that resulted in a negative experience during your visit.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h3>Suggest new features</h3>
            <p>
                We need your input to help us come up with cool new features and improvements for our site. Do you have
                a suggestion? 
                <a class="email-link" href="mailto:inquiries@adultwebmasternet.com?subject=Improve%20message%20in%20regard%20to%20www.qorno.com">We are listening</a>!
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h3>Technical issues</h3>
            <p>
                We develop and test our sites to work with most common operating systems, devices and browsers. However,
                we cannot test them all.
                If you encounter technical difficulties on our site, 
                <a class="email-link" href="mailto:inquiries@adultwebmasternet.com?subject=Improve%20message%20in%20regard%20to%20www.qorno.com">let us know</a> 
                and give us as much relevant information about your device, operating system and
                browser. A screenshot of the issue really helps us out!
            </p>
        </div>

        <div>
            <h3>Translations</h3>
            <p>
                We are working hard to offer our site in multiple languages. All translations have been done by humans
                and are carefully reviewed. However, we are not native speakers of all the languages that are available
                on our site.
                We need your help! If you notice a category (or something else) that seems misspelled or wrongly
                translated please 
                <a class="email-link" href="mailto:inquiries@adultwebmasternet.com?subject=Improve%20message%20in%20regard%20to%20www.qorno.com">let us know</a> 
                what's wrong and what improvements you suggest.
                If possible, please include the URL where we can find the section that needs improvement.
            </p>
        </div>

        <p>Important: We do not store any of your personal data. We only (temporarily) process your personal data if you
            decide to actively provide this to us, such as sending us an email.
            Read more here: 
            <a href="/privacy-statement/" target="_blank">
                <u>www.qorno.com/privacy-statement/</u>
            </a>.
        </p>
    </div>

</div>